# Terms the scan should flag, one case-insensitive extended regex per line.
# Copy this file to .blocklist.local (git-ignored, per machine) and edit it. Lines
# starting with # and empty lines are ignored. The terms below are placeholders.
#
# Consumed by bin/env-scan (and so by scripts/scan.sh and the pre-commit hook)
# and by scripts/export-*.sh. Put your employer, project and host names here:
# this file is the only thing standing between those names and a public commit.
acme-corp
internal-project-name
your\.name@
/Users/yourname
